      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Monthly Revenue Trend | روند ماهانه درآمد",
      "description": "Monthly summed FactSales.SalesAmount (USD). Chart uses month-start timestamps and zero-origin y-axis; a partial-month selection can include partial data.",
